# Runtime dependencies for GitHub's actions/runner:
#   - libicu76: .NET globalization support the runner links against.
#   - dotnet-runtime-8.0: not needed here — the runner ships as a
#     self-contained tarball. Only libicu is strictly required.
libicu76
# Tools the on-boot registration script uses.
curl
jq
# Standard runner-workflow dependencies. GitHub's own runner image
# has hundreds; we keep this thin and let workflows install what
# they need. Add packages here or in image/custom/ per-deployment.
git
ca-certificates
unzip
tar
